# The exhibit runs on Linux; this repo is edited on Windows, where git happily checks files
# out with CRLF. A shell script with CRLF fails on Linux with
#
#   bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M
#
# ...which reads like a missing interpreter and is not. Pin the ones that must stay LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
scripts/exhibit.env.example text eol=lf
